hidden_read_transition.cardlang:25:54: error: mode `closed`'s `transition_to` trigger is a fact every seat can check, but it reads the cards in `hand[0]`, which only its owner can see. Make the holder announce it, as Gin Rummy's knock sets `knocked`, and read the announcement; or read the card as it is played (`action.card`), as Hearts breaks hearts on the card played
